; Ordinary amounts around zero: signs, zeros with places, sums that pass through zero, and
; assertions and assignments on small balances.
2026-01-01 zeros with different places
    a  0 X
    b  0.00 X
    c  -0.0 X
    d  0.000 X
    e

2026-01-02 a sum that returns to zero keeps the places of its terms
    a  12.50 X
    b  -12.5 X
    c  0.00 Y
    d  -0 Y

2026-01-03 ordinary amounts
    a  12.50 X
    b  -7 X
    c  -5.5 X

2026-01-04 balances through zero
    p  -12.50 X = -12.50 X
    q  12.5 X
    r  0 Y
    s  0.00 Y

2026-01-05 back to zero, sign changes
    p  12.50 X = 0 X
    q  -12.5 X
    r  7 X = 7 X
    s  -7 X = -7 X

2026-01-06 and again
    r  -7 X = 0.0 X
    s  7 X = 0 X
    p  -3 X = -3 X
    q  3 X

2026-01-07 assignment up from zero
    t  = 5 X
    u

2026-01-07 assignment down through zero
    t  = -5 X
    u

2026-01-07 assignment back to zero
    t  = 0 X
    u

2026-01-08 a price of zero and a quantity of zero
    a  0 X @ 3 Y
    b  3 X @ 0 Y
    c  2 X @@ 0.00 Y
    d  0 X @@ 5 Y
    e

2026-01-09 a unit price from amounts that cancel
    a  3 X
    b  -3 X
    c  1 Y
    d  -1 Y

2026-01-10 a tenth
    a  10 X
    b  -1 Y

2026-01-11 an inferred price with places on both sides
    a  0.30 X
    b  -0.1 Y
